---
// "The Story Behind SEVENINE"
// Styled after the bold editorial aesthetic: black background, high-contrast big text with italic serif accent, and narrative column
---

<section
  class="relative bg-[#F5EBDD] text-[#28292D] overflow-hidden py-24 sm:py-32 lg:py-40"
  style="background-color: #F5EBDD; color: #28292D;"
  id="about"
  aria-label="The Story Behind SEVENINE"
>
  <!-- Ambient Ethereal Glows (Sepia Tones) -->
  <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 z-0 overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-[800px] h-[800px] bg-[#C17A5D]/10 rounded-full blur-3xl -translate-x-1/3 -translate-y-1/3 mix-blend-multiply"></div>
    <div class="absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-[800px] h-[800px] bg-[#6E5B45]/10 rounded-full blur-3xl translate-x-1/3 translate-y-1/3 mix-blend-multiply"></div>
  </div>

  <!-- Subtle Dot Grid Texture -->
  <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 z-0 opacity-20" style="background-image: radial-gradient(circle, #6E5B45 1.5px, transparent 1.5px); background-size: 24px 24px;"></div>

  <!-- Vertical dashed guide lines continuing the editorial grid -->
  <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 px-3 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 flex justify-between z-[1]">
    <div class="h-full w-px border-l border-dashed border-[#7E7F7E]/30"></div>
    <div class="h-full w-px border-r border-dashed border-[#7E7F7E]/30"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 sm:px-8 lg:px-12 w-full z-10">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-start">
      <!-- Left Column: Big Contrasting Typography -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 flex flex-col gap-4">
        <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] font-semibold text-[#6E5B45]">
          The Story Behind SEVENINE
        </span>

        <h2
          class="text-4xl sm:text-6xl md:text-7xl lg:text-[5.25rem] font-bold tracking-[-0.035em] leading-[1.08] text-[#28292D]"
          style="font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', 'Poppins', sans-serif;"
        >
          Get to know the <br class="hidden sm:inline" />
          story that <br class="hidden sm:inline" />
          <span
            class="font-normal italic tracking-[-0.01em] text-[#C17A5D] inline-block leading-[1.1] pb-1"
            style="font-family: 'Instrument Serif', Georgia, serif;"
          >
            bridges 7 and 9.
          </span>
        </h2>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: Narrative Body Text -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 flex flex-col gap-6 pt-2 lg:pt-10">
        <p class="text-[#28292D] text-lg sm:text-xl font-normal leading-relaxed">
          The name <strong class="text-[#28292D] font-semibold">SEVENINE</strong> draws inspiration from the defining grading scales of world-class curricula: the International Baccalaureate’s iconic <strong class="text-[#28292D] font-semibold">7-point scale</strong> and Cambridge IGCSE’s rigorous <strong class="text-[#28292D] font-semibold">9-point scale</strong>.
        </p>

        <p class="text-[#6E5B45] text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed">
          While IB and IGCSE students share demanding academic rigor, unique project components (like IA, EE, and CAS), and global ambitions, their inter-school communities in Pune have traditionally remained fragmented inside individual campuses.
        </p>

        <p class="text-[#6E5B45] text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed">
          SEVENINE unites these two student communities into a safe, structured, and vibrant inter-school ecosystem, enabling peer mentorship, high-impact collaboration, inter-school athletics, and collective academic excellence across Pune.
        </p>

        <div class="pt-4 flex items-center gap-4">
          <a
            href="#features"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-medium transition-colors group"
            style="color: #C17A5D;"
            onmouseover="this.style.color='#5A767B'"
            onmouseout="this.style.color='#C17A5D'"
          >
            <span>Explore platform features</span>
            <svg
              class="w-4 h-4 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="2"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
            >
              <line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line>
              <polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline>
            </svg>
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- Subtle Legal Footnote -->
        <p class="pt-6 text-[0.72rem] leading-normal text-[#7E7F7E] border-t border-[#7E7F7E]/30">
          *Legal Notice: SEVENINE is an independent student platform and community. It is not affiliated with, authorized, or endorsed by the International Baccalaureate Organization (IBO) or Cambridge Assessment International Education (CAIE). "IB" and "IGCSE" are registered trademarks of their respective owners.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
